# Environment Variables Template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PRATHEESH CLEMENT — DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM 5.0
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
#
# For LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
#   1. Copy this file: cp .env.example .env.local
#   2. Add your Gemini API key to .env.local
#   3. .env.local is gitignored — it will NEVER be committed
#
# For VERCEL DEPLOYMENT:
#   1. Go to your Vercel Dashboard
#   2. Open your project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   3. Add GEMINI_API_KEY with your key value
#   4. Redeploy your project
#
# Get your FREE Gemini API key at:
#   https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# REQUIRED — Gemini AI API Key (Google AI Studio)
# ⚠️  NEVER commit this file with a real key. Only .env.example should be committed.
GEMINI_API_KEY="your_gemini_api_key_here"
